Package: clinicalKpiDashboard
Title: Clinical KPI & Quality Dashboard (Synthea demo)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Shreya", "S", email = "sshreya319@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A portfolio R Shiny dashboard presenting operational and clinical
    quality KPIs (encounter volume, length of stay, 30-day readmissions,
    outcome proxies) derived from synthetic Synthea patient data. Not for
    clinical use.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    shiny,
    bslib,
    plotly,
    reactable,
    shinyWidgets,
    htmlwidgets,
    data.table,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    lubridate,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    rlang,
    scales,
    arrow,
    R.utils
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 17) only if regenerating Synthea data
